---
layout: base.njk
title: "Case Studies — Pragmatic Agents"
description: "Real problems at real scale. Every piece answers one question: what changed because I was here."
permalink: /work/
---
<div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <h1>Case studies</h1>
    <p class="intro">Real problems at real scale. Every piece answers one question: what changed because I was here.</p>

    {% for item in collections.work | sort(attribute='data.order') %}
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-title">{{ item.data.title | accentize | safe }}</span>
      <span class="card-context">{{ item.data.context }}</span>
      <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
      <a class="read-link" href="{{ item.url }}">Read →</a><span class="card-readtime">{{ item.templateContent | readingTime }} min read</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</div>
